# Line endings.
#
# Prettier's `endOfLine` default is `lf`, so the working tree must be LF on every
# platform or `npx prettier --check .` fails on a fresh clone (Windows defaults to
# `core.autocrlf=true`, which would otherwise check files out as CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
